{"operations":[{"content":"# Core hours\n\nThe core working hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026[[cite:obs-7a88f10e674c61367a6fc21bf74b1197437baf5f \"Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026.\"]].\n\nWhere the board resolution of 15 September 2026 and the staff handbook differ, the resolution applies[[cite:obs-7a88f10e674c61367a6fc21bf74b1197437baf5f \"Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026.\"]][[cite:obs-f9757bf8baa5c4a56810adcbda83d5070d3b3b50 \"Core hours are from 10:00 to 16:00 on working days.\"]].\n\nThe staff handbook states core hours as from 10:00 to 16:00 on working days[[cite:obs-f9757bf8baa5c4a56810adcbda83d5070d3b3b50 \"Core hours are from 10:00 to 16:00 on working days.\"]].","expected_sha256":"95599f78b5502ced097bf6c3a8a462f93868e193ae36501badd312db3464f557","kind":"modify","path":"doc/hours.md"}],"rationale":"Added the core working hours from the board resolution as the authoritative source, noted the difference with the staff handbook, and cited both sources exactly as required."}